{"sourceUrl":"https://cyxy.njau.edu.cn/info/1275/9716.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:55.266579+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://cyxy.njau.edu.cn/info/1275/9716.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>南京农业大学是中国草业科学的发祥地，草学学科是江苏省重点学科，建有国家林业和草原局</span><span>“长江中下游草种质资源创新与利用”重点实验室、江苏省高校“草种质资源创新与利用”重点实验室、江苏省林草种质资源库等省部级科研平台，句容南京农业大学草坪研究院服务社会成绩显著。草业科学专业是国家一流专业和江苏省</span></span><span><span>品牌</span></span><span>专业建设点。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>为增强大学生</span></span><span>从事</span><span><span>草学</span></span><span>科研</span><span><span>的兴趣和</span></span><span>热情</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>鼓励优秀大学生报考我院研究生，</span><span>我院将</span><span><span>举办</span><span>“</span><span>南京农业大学草业学院</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span>02</span><span><span>5</span></span><span>年</span><span><span>暑期</span></span><span>优秀</span><span><span>大学生夏令营</span><span>”</span><span>活动</span></span><span>。</span><span>为方便更多同学参与，</span><span>本次活动将</span><span><span>采取线上方式，开展</span><span>“</span><span>云端夏令营</span><span>”</span></span><span>，与导师面对面交流，</span><span><span>欢迎有意报考我院推荐免试</span></span><span>和招考</span><span>（学硕和专硕）</span><span><span>的本科生报名参加。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong>一、时间地点</strong></p>\n<p><span><span>时间：</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span>日</span></p>\n<p><span>地点形式：腾讯会议线上进行</span></p>\n<p><strong>二、招收对象及申请条件</strong></p>\n<p><span>1. </span><span><span>预计具有推荐免试研究生资格或准备报考我院的全国高校优秀本科三年级在校生（</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span>届毕业生），具有</span><span><span>草业科学、作物学、</span></span><span>园艺学、</span><span><span>生物学、</span></span><span>植物保护等</span><span><span>相关学科</span></span><span>背景（不限于）；</span></p>\n<p><span>2. <span>本科期间学习成绩优</span></span><span>良</span><span><span>，未受过任何处分，能按期获得本科毕业证书和学士学位证书</span></span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>3. <span>熟练掌握英语，国家英语四级考试</span><span>425</span><span>分以上</span></span><span>，通过英语六级者优先考虑；</span></p>\n<p><span>4. <span>身体健康，符合体检标准。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong>三、报名材料</strong></p>\n<p><span><span>填写202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span>年全国优秀大学生夏令营申请汇总表（请扫文末二维码填写）；</span></p>\n<p><strong>四、报名方式</strong></p>\n<p><span><a href=\"mailto:1%E3%80%81%E8%AF%B7%E6%9C%89%E6%84%8F%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8C%E5%AD%A6%E7%99%BB%E5%BD%95%E5%8D%97%E4%BA%AC%E5%86%9C%E4%B8%9A%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E8%8D%89%E4%B8%9A%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%BB%E9%A1%B5%EF%BC%8C%E6%B5%8F%E8%A7%88%E5%A4%8F%E4%BB%A4%E8%90%A5%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E7%AD%BE%E5%AD%97%E7%9B%96%E7%AB%A0%E7%9A%84%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E8%A1%A8%E6%89%AB%E6%8F%8F%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8E6%E6%9C%8825%E6%97%A5%E5%89%8D%E5%8F%91%E9%80%81%E8%87%B3yh@njau.edu.cn%EF%BC%8C%E9%82%AE%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%BB%E9%A2%98%E5%8F%8A%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%91%BD%E5%90%8D%E4%B8%BA%E2%80%9C%E5%A4%8F%E4%BB%A4%E8%90%A5-%E6%9C%AC%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1-%E5%A7%93%E5%90%8D-%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E5%8F%B7%E7%A0%81%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">请有意参加的同学登录南京农业大学草业学院主页，浏览夏令营活动通知，</a>7月7日前</span><span><span>填写</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span>年全国优秀大学生夏令营申请汇总表（请扫文末二维码填写）</span><span>，</span><span>并加入</span><span><span>QQ</span><span>群：</span></span><span><span>458431325</span></span><span><span>（南农草业</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span>夏令营）</span><span>，</span><span><span>入群后请改为真实姓名</span><span>+</span><span>学校</span></span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><strong>五</strong><strong>、日程安排</strong></p>\n<div>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>时</span>  <span>间</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>活动内容</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>7</span><span>月</span><span><span>10</span></span><span>日</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>上午</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>启动仪式、学院介绍</span></p><p><span>研究生导师介绍会</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>下午</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>导师学员交流会</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><span>（注：日程安排根据实际情况如有部分调整不再另行通知。）</span></p>\n<p><strong>六</strong><strong>、联系方式</strong></p>\n<p><span>联系人：</span><span>姚</span><span>老师</span></p>\n<p><span><span>电话：</span><span>025-84395017</span></span></p>\n<p><span>E-</span><span>mail</span><span>：</span> <a href=\"mailto:yh@njau.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>yh@njau.edu.cn</span></span></span></a></p>\n<p><span><span>QQ</span><span>群：</span></span><span><span>458431325</span></span><span><span>（南农草业</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span>夏令营）</span><span>，</span><span><span>入群后请改为真实姓名</span><span>+</span><span>学校</span></span></p>\n<p><span>欢迎相关专业的优秀青年学子踊跃报名！</span></p>\n<p><span>二维码：</span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cyxy.njau.edu.cn/__local/F/BA/79/DE1EAC07A3D57471E7FAD0CE94A_7417D439_6B89.png\"/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>南京农业大学草业学院</span>    </span></p>\n<p><span><span>                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                2025</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>27</span><span>日  </span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"20d1644aa09115e4f51f9b54a585753f06ef337b81ab0c21e5168eb230bf4855","textLength":876,"sourceSha256":"73e47382be87a443ece04cda83bc74a88d6b6e96f4e060de246264bb9e182582","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a3219860f5fc71f955b3","title":"2025年南京农业大学草业学院关于举办 “2025年暑期优秀大学生夏令营”活动的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:55.266579+00:00"}
